def binary_search(arr, target):
    left, right = 0, len(arr)-1
    while left <= right:
        mid = (left+right)//2
        if arr[mid] == target:
            return mid
        elif arr[mid] < target:
            left = mid+1
        else:
            right = mid-1
    return -1
Time complexity is O(log n) because we divide the search space in half each iteration.

